@startuml SystemContext_NotifiED_Simplified
 
title System Context Diagram - NotifiED (Simplified per Adviser Feedback)
 
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
 
skinparam rectangle {
    BorderColor #666666
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    FontSize 14
}
 
skinparam arrow {
    Color #666666
    FontColor #333333
    FontSize 12
}
 
' ===== Person =====
rectangle "**Student**\n<size:11>A university student who wants to discover\ncampus events, view their calendar, access\ninstitutional email, and manage their profile\nfrom a single application.</size>" as student #08427B
 
' ===== Core System (in scope) =====
rectangle "**NotifiED Mobile Application**\n<size:11>React Native app providing event discovery,\norganization directory, calendar viewing, email\naccess, AI-assisted interaction, notifications,\nand profile management.\n(Team 2 - our system)</size>" as notified #1168BD
 
' ===== External Systems =====
rectangle "**Microsoft Identity Platform**\n<size:11>Authenticates students using their\ninstitutional Microsoft account. Issues\nauthorization tokens used to access the\nstudent's calendar and email, and to\nredirect to their institutional email.</size>" as msIdentity #999999
 
rectangle "**NotifiED Backend**\n<size:11>Manages event submission, approval, and\norganization data. Stores the student's\nNotifiED profile. Exposes this information\nthrough standardized APIs.\n(Developed by Team 1)</size>" as backendService #999999
 
' ===== Relationships =====
student -down-> notified : "Signs in, views events,\ncalendar, email access,\nprofile, and notifications"
 
notified -right-> msIdentity : "Authenticates student, retrieves\ncalendar, redirects to email\n<size:10>[OAuth 2.0 / HTTPS]</size>"
 
notified -down-> backendService : "Requests events, organizations,\nand student profile data\n<size:10>[REST API / HTTPS]</size>"
 
' ===== Legend =====
legend right
  |= Color |= Type |
  |<#08427B>| Person |
  |<#1168BD>| System (In Scope) |
  |<#999999>| External System |
endlegend
 
@enduml